{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753510/extras/6cda313a5cbfd7ab53e40c9e3d0f6989.avif?t=1765448999\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant prehistoric world with Cavemen Tales: Prehistoric Adventure. Join Sam and Crystal as they lead their tribe to a new home, navigating through dozens of exciting levels filled with challenges, hidden treasures, and intriguing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and colorful time management game you will explore, guide the tribe, build, gather resources, overcome obstacles along the way and enjoy the tale of family, friendship and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, be aware not everyone really has honest intentions. There are people who only strive to power and wealth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753510/extras/01a7c28b6d8fda0a91ece096cd97ae59.avif?t=1765448999\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Dozens of levels packed with city building fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Build, upgrade, and defend your towns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Use powerful boosts &amp; unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Intriguing narrative \u2014 a plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to gather resources, build houses, manage workers, and keep your people thriving as you progress through each level. Use boosts when things get tough \u2014 but the real reward is mastering strategy and efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand, optimize, upgrade, and develop your settlements the way you like. Customizable challenge \u2014 Relaxed, Standard, and Extreme difficulty modes. Earn Achievements as you complete objectives and perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Immersive adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mix of colorful art, atmosphere, and story-rich progression paired with satisfying time-management and city-building mechanics. Whether you enjoy calm, casual resource gathering or intense strategic challenges \u2014 this game delivers both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753510/extras/702f8ac782f1feae6a88bfc08002104f.avif?t=1765448999\" width=630 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This COLLECTOR'S EDITION version contains some special features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus levels with extended story-line </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Gallery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753510/extras/f0f44b820a2849beb2caeb81b6b73741.avif?t=1765448999\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Help Sam and Crystal and their family to find a new home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the prehistoric era and meet peculiar characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stop the bad guys from ruining tribe's happiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dozens of exciting levels to master and hundreds of quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find hidden treasures and win achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 difficulty modes: relaxed, timed and extreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step-by-step tutorials for beginners</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Call Of The Wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/5804741e164fbb33f2d5fbeb82600a1c4f339d5a.jpg"},{"name":"Party Animals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/1232c205310f0237edb8e8e5e69012c9ee7d38bc.jpg"},{"name":"Dino Tamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/371af46a62c55e7c619deb928064c943de2601c5.jpg"},{"name":"Eye Of the Tiger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/104aac6bbcbe502abf059d2aa3e0c000ae9b2a02.jpg"},{"name":"Cash Cow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/9f3e2cf6009cf5b839def0e89acfe91587f11bf9.jpg"},{"name":"Food Chain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/d948650d50ef9bf532ca74d7281051bdaae70c38.jpg"},{"name":"Lion's Share","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/9b8e8f1e3bb6e88b08affdd8d754f378ba378db3.jpg"},{"name":"Bird Of Paradise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1753510/270802643552371ea1c9656398edc0d06bea18db.jpg"},{"name":"Call Of the Wild","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima